### 9. Add Crop Sale Entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "crop": 1,
    "buyer_name": "Sharma Traders Indore Mandi",
    "quantity_quintals": "50.00",
    "price_per_quintal": "2850.00",
    "total_amount": "142500.00",
    "sale_date": "2026-10-15",
    "payment_status": "Paid",
    "remarks": "Bill No 102"
}

### 10. Public Mandi Prices API (No Token Needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/mandi-prices/

### 11. Public Government Schemes API (No Token Needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/schemes/